          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Longstanding irritability, marked mood swings, bloating, breast tenderness, and headaches during the week before menses; symptoms settle 1–2 days after bleeding starts, with the patient essentially well mid-cycle."
